WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:11.034
Hi! Look, the dog is running! How do we talk about things happening right now? Today we'll learn the present continuous tense.

2
00:00:11.184 --> 00:00:16.290
Now, Look! and Listen! tell us it is happening right now.

3
00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:19.170
With I, use am: I am reading.

4
00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:23.346
For one person or thing, use is: she is singing.

5
00:00:23.496 --> 00:00:28.098
With you, we and they, use are: they are playing.

6
00:00:28.248 --> 00:00:31.266
Most verbs just add ing.

7
00:00:31.416 --> 00:00:35.130
Verbs ending in e drop the e: writing, making.

8
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:41.826
Short vowel plus one consonant: double it, then add ing: running, swimming.

9
00:00:41.976 --> 00:00:45.978
Always include am, is or are.

10
00:00:46.128 --> 00:00:50.970
Watch out! Writing only running and leaving out are is wrong!

11
00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:54.282
The boys means many, so we use are.

12
00:00:54.432 --> 00:00:58.170
So it's The boys are running.

13
00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:08.106
Your turn! Listen! Mei, ___, singing. Which one? Pause and think.

14
00:01:08.256 --> 00:01:13.626
Mei is one person, so is. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:13.776 --> 00:01:23.322
Another one! I am, ___, a letter now. Which one? Pause and think.

16
00:01:23.472 --> 00:01:29.250
Drop the e and add ing: writing. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:38.898
Here's another! The fish are, ___, in the tank. Which one? Pause and think.

18
00:01:39.048 --> 00:01:44.826
Swim doubles the m: swimming. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:44.976 --> 00:01:54.714
Try one more! We, ___, watching TV now. Which one? Pause and think.

20
00:01:54.864 --> 00:01:59.370
We takes are. Did you get it right?

21
00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:09.426
Try one more! Look! The baby is, ___. Which one? Pause and think.

22
00:02:09.576 --> 00:02:14.610
Happening now: sleeping. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:24.354
Try one more! Dad is, ___, the car now. Which one? Pause and think.

24
00:02:24.504 --> 00:02:30.786
After is, use the ing form: washing. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:30.936 --> 00:02:40.218
Try one more! The boys, ___, running. Is or are? Pause and think.

26
00:02:40.368 --> 00:02:45.378
Many boys, so are. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:45.528 --> 00:02:55.122
Last one! Look! The birds, ___. Which one? Pause and think.

28
00:02:55.272 --> 00:03:01.314
Look shows it is happening now: are flying. Did you get it right?

29
00:03:01.464 --> 00:03:07.553
Remember: for things happening now, use am, is or are plus the ing form.

30
00:03:07.703 --> 00:03:12.305
Look out of the window and say what people are doing!

